OL,4,CPregnant US inmate escapes in prison   
OL,5,Cvehicle after medical appointment      
OL,6,GA pregnant inmate has escaped from     
OL,7,Gcustody in the US state of New Mexico, 
OL,8,Gafter taking control of a police       
OL,9,Gvehicle while returning to prison from 
OL,10,Ga prenatal appointment, the state's    
OL,11,Gcorrections department has said.       
OL,13,FRebecca Taylor, 26, took control of    
OL,14,Fthe Dodge Journey and drove away when  
OL,15,Fthe team transporting her and another  
OL,16,Finmate stopped to pick up food in      
OL,17,FAlbuquerque, local media reported.     
OL,19,FThe New Mexico Corrections Department  
OL,20,Fsaid that the vehicle and her prison   
OL,21,Fjumpsuit were later recovered, but     
OL,22,FTaylor remains on the run.             
